---
title: AdviseCare - Activity Diagram - WF1 Admin Creates Accounts
---

flowchart TD
    S((Start)) --> A1[Admin signs in]
    A1 --> D1{How are the accounts created?}
    D1 -->|Bulk| B1[Upload Excel file: email, fullName, userName, facultyCode, role, studentCode, academicStatus]
    B1 --> B2[System validates every row: required fields, formats, duplicates, faculty and role exist, 5 or 7 filled columns]
    B2 --> D2{Any invalid row?}
    D2 -->|Yes| B3[Show the invalid rows, nothing is created]
    B3 --> B1
    D2 -->|No| B4[Create accounts, roles and student profiles in one save: no password, linkStatus = notLinked]
    D1 -->|Single| C1[Fill email, full name, username, faculty, roles, and student code and academic status for a Student]
    C1 --> C2[System validates and creates the account and its student profile]
    B4 --> E1[System prompts to send account-linking emails]
    C2 --> E1
    E1 --> D3{Admin confirms?}
    D3 -->|Yes| E2[Email a one-time link valid 7 days, linkStatus = emailSent]
    D3 -->|Later| F1
    E2 --> F1[Admin views the account dashboard: filter by role, faculty, student code, academic status, link status, account status]
    F1 --> D4{Account still emailSent after a while?}
    D4 -->|Yes| F2[Resend the linking email]
    D4 -->|No| F3[Edit details, roles or student profile, deactivate or ban when needed]
    F2 --> X((End))
    F3 --> X
